        {
          "text": "Kuwaasu waa intii laga tiriyey reer binu Israa'iil siday reerahoodu ahaayeen. Kulli intii xerooyinka laga tiriyey sidii ciidammadoodii ahaayeen waxay ahaayeen lix boqol iyo saddex kun iyo shan boqol iyo konton. ",
