        {
          "text": "Sidaasay reer binu Israa'iil yeeleen, oo kulli wixii Rabbigu Muuse ku amray, sidaasay dhammaan uga ag dhisteen calammadoodii, oo sidaasay ugu bexeen siday qoladoodii iyo reerahoodii ahaayeen.",
